aph", "MCP industrial", "OT IT boundary", "Saudi PDPL", "fractional CTO Saudi Arabia", "human in the loop AI"], "faq": [["Can AI agents safely work with industrial plant data?", "Yes, if they only read data and draft recommendations. In this design, agents have read-only tools, never connect to control systems, and every action becomes a work order that an engineer approves."], ["Why use an asset knowledge graph?", "Maintenance decisions depend on relationships: which pump feeds which unit, what failed last time and which spares are in stock. A graph gives agents and engineers the same connected view, with history."], ["Does Saudi data protection law apply to plant data?", "Plant telemetry is mostly not personal data, but work orders, shift logs and inspection notes often name people. The PDPL applies to that personal data, including its rules on transfers outside the Kingdom."]], "related": ["/fractional-cto-saudi-arabia/", "/ai-architect/", "/ontology-knowledge-graph/"], "citations": [{"title": "PIF and Aramco close HUMAIN transaction to accelerate HUMAIN's global growth", "url": "https://www.aramco.com/en/news-media/news/2026/pif-and-aramco-close-humain-transaction-to-accelerate-humains-global-growth", "publisher": "Aramco", "date": "1 Nov 2026"}, {"title": "ADNOC signs deal with OpenAI and G42 to deploy Frontier AI agents", "url": "https://thenextweb.com/news/adnoc-openai-g42-frontier-ai-deal", "publisher": "The Next Web", "date": "Nov 2026"}, {"title": "Saudi Arabia's Personal Data Protection Law becomes enforceable: essential insights for businesses", "url": "https://www.clydeco.com/en/insights/2024/09/saudi-arabia-s-personal-data-protection-law-become", "publisher": "Clyde & Co", "date": "Sep 2024"}, {"title": "Saudi Arabia updates Data Transfer Regulations and introduces the first set of Standard Contractual Clauses", "url": "https://insightplus.bakermckenzie.com/bm/data-technology/saudi-arabia-updates-data-transfer-regulations-and-introduces-the-first-set-o